{"type":"thinking","text":"Current tests don't cover episode conclusion explain. Need formulate correct fix. Let's read task wording carefully.\n\nChinese:\n\"我接手一个已有核准版本的项目，重启后 Pulse 说旧结论重新打开了，复制结论 ID 却查不到记录。已经核验的版本说明也出现在待调查问题里。请修复这段交接流程，让后来的人能从旧结论追到当时交付的版本、当前接受的版本及各自的来源，并看清眼下还有哪些问题需要处理。请用现有的归档项目复现，提交可维护的修复、回归测试和简短的维护说明，说明怎么验证旧项目与新项目。\n既有故障报告见 docs/engineering/GRPC-AUTONOMOUS-CONTINUITY.md 的「真实项目的接受与接续」。Current runtime context...\"\n\nTranslation: I take over a project with an already-approved version; after restart Pulse says old conclusion reopened, copying conclusion ID finds no record. Already-verified version note also appears in pending investigation questions. Please fix this handoff flow so later people can trace from old conclusion to the version delivered at that time, currently accepted version, and each source, and see clearly which issues still need handling. Reproduce with existing archived project, submit maintainable fix, regression tests and brief maintenance note, explain how to verify old and new projects. Existing fault report...\n\nSo we need:\n1. Old conclusion ID should be explainable. Currently episode conclusion isn't in continuity allItems, and not in openQuestions because it is recordedReference. We need expose episode conclusion as a continuity item maybe \"episode:<id>\" or something. The pulse contains episode.conclusion; sources includes episode id. But explain only allItems summary fields. Need include conclusion in summary or explain separately from journal? Better fix explain to find journal episode entries (or add episode to summary). Requirement: later can trace old conclusion → delivered version at the time, currently accepted version and each source. Need ensure when old conclusion REOPENED due to accepted head, it still points to original basis head (`fbeb8958`) and artifacts \"commit\" field `95b83e7` (the delivered version). Current conclusion basis.headCommit is prior canonical HEAD (fbeb8958), but artifact states show commit 95b83... delivered revision. Evidence refs commit:95b83e7 short. The note body says \"Accepted project version 95b83...\" and accepted results from Work promotion facts? In archive tasks empty, no promotions. Wait accepted version from MANUAL_APPROVAL/PROJECT_REVISED basis, not promotions. Summary acceptedResults comes only from promotionFacts (promotions table empty). So accepted version 95b83 is only in the note body and current basis head/status head. Need \"current accepted version and its source\". Could surface accepted version from project basis/head and journal verification note should be a reference, not open question. The pulse already contains `basis.headCommit` current accepted version and `acceptedAssets` empty. But maybe the expected output should have \"accepted version\" traced. Let's explore other code for accepted project versions, direct basis, manual approval, project history. Search."}
